    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 754728059887616
    m_Localized: '(pt-PT) The friend with the best computer

      should host.


      Are
      you this friend?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 754728059887617
    m_Localized: 'Haha sim! :) '
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 754728059887618
    m_Localized: "Eu n\xE3o..  :'("
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 754728059887619
    m_Localized: Alerta
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 754728059887620
    m_Localized: (pt-PT) While playing with random players you may come across cheaters
      or really mean people...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 754728059887621
    m_Localized: Entendido
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 754728059887622
    m_Localized: "N\xE3o, obrigado :("
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
